If you restore from an incremental, does it allow you to remove the
files that weren't there when the incremental was taken or do you
have to do that by hand?

>>I recommend using tar for full backups, and cpio for incremental backups,
>>because cpio accepts a list of filenames on stdin that it will backup. This
