jmaynard@nyx10.cs.du.edu (Jay Maynard) wrote:

> I can't seem to get WAIS 8b5.1 (I think that's the version) to compile on our 
> Alpha 3000/400 with OSF/1 1.3A. It seems it can't figure out that it's a 
> standard C compiler. I'm sure someone out there has gotten this running...how 
